'''Psykk bats''' can be found inside the [[Chambers of Xeric]] where they can be caught using a [[butterfly net]] in order to obtain a [[raw psykk bat (6)]]. They require a [[Hunter]] level of 90 to catch and grant 29 Hunter experience. Once caught, raw psykk bats can be cooked into a [[psykk bat (6)]], requiring a [[Cooking]] level of 90 and granting 28 Cooking experience.

